<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal injects 67 bln esc 7.25 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal injects 67 bln esc 7.25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it injected 67 billion escudos into the money market at a weighted interest rate of 7.25 percent in a securities repurchase tender at the start of a new eight-day commercial bank reserve period effective on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It previously injected funds at 7.25 percent.</p>
</text>
